<title>USA: Conoco sets $46 mln in employee bonuses.</title>
<headline>Conoco sets $46 mln in employee bonuses.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conoco Inc, the oil exploration and refining subsidiary of DuPont Co, said it will distribute bonus payments of almost $46 million for 1996 to about 11,000 non-management employees worldwide.</p>
<p>Conoco said the bonuses are more than double what they were in 1995, reflecting the company's second best earnings performance in its history, totaling $901 million.</p>
